# The delegated SharePoint token cache is written into this directory by
# scripts/sharepoint-device-login.sh, and mounted read-only into plugin-batch-ingester at
# /var/lib/content-lake/sharepoint-auth.
#
# The directory is tracked so the bind mount has something to mount on a fresh checkout. Its contents are
# not, and must not be: the cache holds a refresh token, which outlives the access tokens it mints and can be
# redeemed from anywhere.
